A .GDP file is a game data package file these files are just Game DLC (Downloadable Content) these do not work without my file converter but sadly that has been taken down:(
How to use one. First make a folder in your c:drive called "Game Data Package" next get the "GDP AUTO" Installer from my github or discord if you dont see it, it was taken down
next open the installer then click next and install now Download the .GDP for the game you want then run GDP AUTO it will scan for the .GDP and if it doesnt find it use the manual convertor
now once it converts the file it will ask where to put it just select the folder your game is in now your donw:)
